<p>Shroud foes within radius 10 in darkest light, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">29, 39, 46, 53, 58</acronym> light and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">29, 39, 46, 53, 58</acronym> darkness damage per turn and converting <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9%, 25%, 36%, 46%, 55%</acronym> of the damage they deal between light and darkness for 5 turns.</p>